# The image build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT (server/Dockerfile copies
# the sibling packages/campaign_contracts path dependency), so this file must
# live here: Docker only reads .dockerignore from the context root, which is
# why the old server/.dockerignore was silently ineffective (slice-1 final
# review, deferred finding).
#
# Allowlist style: drop everything, re-admit only what the server image
# needs, then re-drop the junk inside those trees. Without this the context
# uploads the whole repo — including build/ with a ~220MB APK per e2e build.
*
!server/
!packages/
server/.dart_tool/
server/build/
server/test/
packages/**/.dart_tool/
